{"seq":2,"slug":"sequence-level-kd","title":"序列级蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-distillation/methods/sequence-level-kd","wordCount":1791,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"序列级蒸馏\">序列级蒸馏</h1><p>逐个 token 都和教师对齐，生成出来的整句话却不像教师——这个矛盾在 2016 年 Kim 与 Rush 做神经机器翻译蒸馏时就被点破。原因是自回归生成里，每一步的微小偏差会沿序列累积放大，token 级的局部对齐管不住全局轨迹。序列级蒸馏放弃「逐位置匹配分布」，转而直接拿「整条序列」当目标。这条思路恰好也绕开了对教师 logits 的依赖，成了今天 DeepSeek-R1-Distill 那套推理蒸馏的方法地基。本篇是 hub 里序列级目标与 on-policy 的详述处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>token 级蒸馏（见 <a href=\"soft-label-kd\">软标签蒸馏</a>）匹配的是每个位置的条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\cdot \\mid y_{&lt;t}, x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；序列级蒸馏匹配的是整条序列的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y \\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。理想的序列级目标是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>y</mi></munder><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{seq} = \\mathrm{KL}\\big(p(y\\mid x) \\,\\|\\, q(y\\mid x)\\big) = -\\sum_{y} p(y\\mid x)\\log q(y\\mid x) + \\text{const}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4361em;vertical-align:-1.3861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">const</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 的空间是指数级的，无法穷举求和。SeqKD 的关键近似是：用教师的最优输出（beam search 结果）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 当作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的一个点估计，目标退化成让学生最大化教师那条序列的似然——也就是在「教师生成的数据」上做普通 SFT。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    X[输入 x] --&gt; T[教师模型]&#10;    T --&gt;|beam search| YHAT[教师最优序列 y_hat]&#10;    YHAT --&gt; SFT[学生在 y_hat 上&lt;br/&gt;做交叉熵 SFT]&#10;    SFT --&gt; S[学生模型]&#10;    S --&gt;|on-policy 时| GEN[学生自生成序列]&#10;    GEN --&gt;|教师评分/纠正| FB[反馈]&#10;    FB --&gt; S\">flowchart TD\n    X[输入 x] --&gt; T[教师模型]\n    T --&gt;|beam search| YHAT[教师最优序列 y_hat]\n    YHAT --&gt; SFT[学生在 y_hat 上&lt;br/&gt;做交叉熵 SFT]\n    SFT --&gt; S[学生模型]\n    S --&gt;|on-policy 时| GEN[学生自生成序列]\n    GEN --&gt;|教师评分/纠正| FB[反馈]\n    FB --&gt; S</pre><p>下表对照三种序列级路线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>训练数据来源</th>\n<th>是否需教师 logits</th>\n<th>曝光偏差</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SeqKD</td>\n<td>教师 beam 输出（离线）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>存在</td>\n<td>Kim &amp; Rush 2016</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>on-policy 蒸馏</td>\n<td>学生自生成 + 教师反馈</td>\n<td>否（黑盒可行）</td>\n<td>缓解</td>\n<td>GKD/2025 OPD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒绝采样蒸馏</td>\n<td>教师多次采样后筛选</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>存在</td>\n<td>R1-Distill 数据侧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"seqkd-把序列目标近似成-sft\">SeqKD：把序列目标近似成 SFT</h2><p>SeqKD 的做法朴素得令人意外：让教师对每个输入跑 beam search 生成一条高质量序列，把这些 (输入, 教师序列) 对当成训练集，对学生做标准交叉熵微调。它的合理性在于——教师的 beam 输出近似了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>y</mi></msub><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arg\\max_y p(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，学生去拟合这个 mode，等价于一种 mode-seeking 的序列级蒸馏。</p>\n<p>SeqKD 的最大优点是<strong>不需要教师 logits</strong>：只要教师能生成文本就行，因此天然适用于只有 API 的黑盒教师（见 <a href=\"white-vs-black-box\">白盒与黑盒蒸馏</a>）。它在实现上和普通 SFT 几乎无法区分，差别只在「标注者是教师」——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/distillation-vs-compression\">蒸馏与压缩边界</a> 里说的「以教师为标注者的微调」。DeepSeek-R1-Distill 的主体就是这条路线的放大版：用 R1 生成约 80 万条推理与通用任务的轨迹，对 Qwen/Llama 骨架纯 SFT，不加 RL。</p>\n<h2 id=\"曝光偏差与-on-policy-蒸馏\">曝光偏差与 on-policy 蒸馏</h2><p>SeqKD 在教师轨迹上训练，但学生推理时走的是<strong>自己</strong>生成的轨迹。一旦某步偏离教师从没示范过的区域，后续就进入「训练时没见过」的状态，错误累积——这就是<strong>曝光偏差</strong>（exposure bias）。</p>\n<p>on-policy 蒸馏的修法是：让学生在<strong>自己生成的序列</strong>上接受教师的指导。形式上，对学生采样出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y \\sim q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，用教师分布去拉它回正轨。这要么需要教师 logits（白盒），要么需要把教师当成奖励/偏好信号（黑盒下用判别器或偏好对）。2025–2026 年的 on-policy 蒸馏（OPD）方向相当活跃：Online KD with Reward Guidance 用偏好优化做在线变体，ORPO-Distill 用混合策略的偏好蒸馏支持跨架构黑盒迁移，SODA（2026）用教师响应配学生生成的静态快照组成偏好对做半 on-policy 蒸馏。这些方法的共性是把「学生自生成 + 教师反馈」做成训练闭环，系统缓解曝光偏差。on-policy 与黑盒的结合（GAD）在 <a href=\"white-vs-black-box\">白盒与黑盒蒸馏</a> 里详谈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拒绝采样-序列级数据的质量阀\">拒绝采样：序列级数据的质量阀</h2><p>序列级蒸馏的成败高度依赖教师序列的质量。直接拿 beam/采样输出可能掺入教师的错误。<strong>拒绝采样</strong>（rejection sampling）是数据侧的质量阀：让教师对同一输入采多条轨迹，只保留通过校验（答案正确、格式合规、长度合理）的，再喂给学生。R1-Distill 的数据构造大量使用这一手——对有标准答案的数学/代码题，用答案正确性当过滤器。这把「方法」和「数据工程」缝在一起，完整的过滤与去重流程见 <a href=\"../practice/distillation-data-pipeline\">蒸馏数据流水线</a>。</p>\n<p>值得注意的是，反复采教师、只留通过的样本，会系统性收窄分布、放大教师偏好，长期看是模型坍塌的诱因之一，见 <a href=\"../reasoning/distillation-collapse\">蒸馏坍塌与多样性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"token-级与序列级何时各占优\">token 级与序列级何时各占优</h2><p>两条路线不是替代而是互补，选哪条取决于约束与目标。下面给一个落地判据，避免在实践中乱选。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐路线</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拿得到教师每位置 logits、任务偏分类</td>\n<td>token 级（软标签）</td>\n<td>信号最密，可离线解析，训练稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>教师只有文本 API（黑盒）</td>\n<td>序列级 SeqKD</td>\n<td>不需 logits，唯一可行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学生推理时分布漂移严重</td>\n<td>on-policy 序列级</td>\n<td>在自生成轨迹上纠偏，治曝光偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长 CoT 推理蒸馏</td>\n<td>序列级 + 拒绝采样</td>\n<td>轨迹是整体，逐位置匹配意义不大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常被忽视的细节是<strong>两条路线可以混合</strong>：先用序列级 SeqKD 让学生进入教师轨迹的「大致区域」，再用 token 级软标签或 on-policy 微调精修每个位置，兼得序列级的全局一致与 token 级的局部精度。R1-Distill 主体是序列级 SFT，但后续若要进一步压能力差，常再叠一轮 on-policy 校正。</p>\n<p>还要注意序列级蒸馏对<strong>学生 tokenizer</strong>的敏感：教师与学生若用不同分词器，教师序列在学生侧的切分会变，逐 token 的 SFT 目标随之偏移。实践中要么统一 tokenizer，要么在序列级（文本层面）对齐而非 token 层面对齐——这也是序列级方法在跨家族蒸馏（如 GPT 系教师蒸 Qwen 学生）里更鲁棒的原因之一，呼应 <a href=\"white-vs-black-box\">白盒与黑盒蒸馏</a> 里跨架构黑盒迁移的讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>序列级蒸馏匹配整条序列分布而非逐位置分布，解决 token 级对齐管不住全局轨迹的问题。</li>\n<li><strong>SeqKD</strong> 用教师 beam 输出当目标，把序列级目标近似成在教师数据上的 SFT，不需要 logits，天然适配黑盒教师；R1-Distill 是其放大版。</li>\n<li><strong>曝光偏差</strong>是 SeqKD 的软肋；<strong>on-policy 蒸馏</strong>（2025–2026 的 OPD/ORPO/SODA 等）让学生在自生成轨迹上受教师反馈，系统缓解。</li>\n<li><strong>拒绝采样</strong>是序列级数据的质量阀，但过度筛选会诱发坍塌。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读-跨链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨链接</h3><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"soft-label-kd\">软标签蒸馏</a> —— token 级方法与 GKD，序列级的对照面。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"white-vs-black-box\">白盒与黑盒蒸馏</a> —— SeqKD/on-policy 与访问权限的关系。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/distillation-data-pipeline\">蒸馏数据流水线</a> —— 拒绝采样与过滤的完整流程。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../reasoning/cot-distillation\">思维链蒸馏</a> —— R1-Distill 这条序列级路线的推理应用。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/alignment-techniques/sft\">LLM 微调 · SFT</a> —— 序列级蒸馏所复用的微调机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>数据来源：Kim &amp; Rush《Sequence-Level Knowledge Distillation》(2016, arxiv.org/abs/1606.07947)；DeepSeek-R1 技术报告（arxiv.org/abs/2501.12948）；on-policy 蒸馏精选集（github.com/chrisliu298/awesome-on-policy-distillation）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"序列级蒸馏","id":"序列级蒸馏"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SeqKD：把序列目标近似成 SFT","id":"seqkd-把序列目标近似成-sft"},{"level":2,"text":"曝光偏差与 on-policy 蒸馏","id":"曝光偏差与-on-policy-蒸馏"},{"level":2,"text":"拒绝采样：序列级数据的质量阀","id":"拒绝采样-序列级数据的质量阀"},{"level":2,"text":"token 级与序列级何时各占优","id":"token-级与序列级何时各占优"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨链接"}],"prev":{"title":"软标签蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-distillation/methods/soft-label-kd"},"next":{"title":"白盒与黑盒蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-distillation/methods/white-vs-black-box"}}